# Byrke, Long Ear of the Law: "When Byrke enters, put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target creatures." Bot1 controls
# Memnite and Ornithopter when Byrke enters, so three creatures are candidates (Byrke himself is one): naming all three is
# refused (at most two), and choosing none is allowed ("up to"), so no creature gets a counter.

